<ToolLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="How this website handles your data. The tools run in your browser and your files are never uploaded.">
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p><em>Last updated: October 2026</em></p>

  <h2>Your files stay on your device</h2>
  <p>All tools on this website run inside your web browser. The files and text you add are processed on your own device and are never uploaded to our servers.</p>

  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <p>We do not ask you to create an account and we do not collect personal information through the tools. Like most websites, our hosting provider may keep standard server logs (such as IP address, browser type, and pages visited) for security and performance.</p>

  <h2>Cookies and advertising</h2>
  <p>This website may show advertising and may use analytics in the future. If so, third-party services such as Google may use cookies to show ads and measure traffic. You can manage ad personalization in your Google ad settings and in your browser.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>If you have questions about this policy, see our <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.</p>
</ToolLayout>